**Status:** BLOCKED ({{ $json.block_count }} critical violation{{ $json.block_count > 1 ? 's' : '' }})
**Opportunity:** {{ $json.opportunity_id }}

**Critical Violations:**
{{ $json.violations.filter(v => v.severity === 'block').map(v => '❌ ' + v.type + ': "' + (v.original_text || '').substring(0, 100) + '..."\n  → ' + (v.suggestion || 'Must be rewritten')).join('\n') }}

**Guardian Notes:** {{ $json.overall_notes }}

👉 This draft has been returned to the content agent for rewriting. It will NOT be sent for human approval.
